## API Efficiency Strategy

- **Groq (GPT-OSS-120B):** Handles ALL text extraction and classification — generous free-tier limits
- **Gemini:** NOT used at all for these 8 books (reserved for `Case in Point` later)  
- **Embeddings:** `all-mpnet-base-v2` runs locally via `sentence-transformers` — zero API cost
- **Rate limiting:** 3-second sleep between Groq calls, 5 retries with exponential backoff on 429s
- **Chunking:** ~8,000 char windows mean ~5-10 API calls per book (vs. 100+ page-by-page)

